{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project","id":1039523,"title":"How would you do a archeological dig as a God-Machine project?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-28T11:20:38-08:00","id":1039523,"title":"How would you do a archeological dig as a God-Machine project?","content":"I thought up of a scenario for a possible Demon campaign if I get the game. It is basically a archeological dig in the Arizona desert being sponsored by a corporation called Manticore Software, a God-Machine influenced company. My question is what could the God-Machine do with a archeological dig and what type of infrastructure could it be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T13:04:10-08:00","id":1039569,"title":"","content":"Immediate thoughts are that a piece of old infrastructure retired a thousand years ago is calculated to be of use in some new occult matrix and must be reactivated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T13:06:23-08:00","id":1039571,"title":"","content":"Questions: <br /> Why is a software company sponsoring an archeological dig?<br /> How in depth or important do you want these?<br /> Any other cosmological considerations?<br /> <br /> Ideas:<br /> The dig could itself be part of an Occult Matrix - a single incident/output (summon angel, major effect, create a time portal, etc.), or to establish new Infrastructure at the site.<br /> There could be dormant/damaged Infrastructure under the dig site - maybe Demon's Suborned it and were since eliminated, bad luck, it was supposed to be Eliminated but wasn't (maybe the Angel responsible Fell). It could even be an Angel Storage Facility (it was more efficient to let it get buried and dig it up later).<br /> There could be something outside the G-M there that It wants - some artifact It wants to analyze, some threat It wants to counter, etc.<br /> It could even be a trap - make it look interesting, lure Demons in then snap them up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T13:36:28-08:00","id":1039581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039571#post1039571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Questions:<br /> Why is a software company sponsoring an archeological dig?<br /> How in depth or important do you want these?<br /> Any other cosmological considerations?<br /> <br /> Ideas:<br /> The dig could itself be part of an Occult Matrix - a single incident/output (summon angel, major effect, create a time portal, etc.), or to establish new Infrastructure at the site.<br /> There could be dormant/damaged Infrastructure under the dig site - maybe Demon's Suborned it and were since eliminated, bad luck, it was supposed to be Eliminated but wasn't (maybe the Angel responsible Fell). It could even be an Angel Storage Facility (it was more efficient to let it get buried and dig it up later).<br /> There could be something outside the G-M there that It wants - some artifact It wants to analyze, some threat It wants to counter, etc.<br /> It could even be a trap - make it look interesting, lure Demons in then snap them up.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThe CEO is probably using it as a ploy to dig up the infrastructure. Also, the infrastructure could contain a old artifact made by the machine during the time when the Hopi Indians were around. Also, the infrastructure could be disguised as a old temple.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T16:17:50-08:00","id":1039658,"title":"","content":"That's your reason why, yes, but If I heard of a software company doing an archeological dig, I'd go &quot;What&quot;? Archeology isn't noticeably relevant for software. I doubt there is much of a charity angle there. Maybe PR? But that's shining a big spotlight on the activity.<br /> <br /> Doing it through a software company is the opposite of subtle, is what I'm saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T16:27:12-08:00","id":1039665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039658#post1039658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's your reason why, yes, but If I heard of a software company doing an archeological dig, I'd go &quot;What&quot;? Archeology isn't noticeably relevant for software. I doubt there is much of a charity angle there. Maybe PR? But that's shining a big spotlight on the activity.<br /> <br /> Doing it through a software company is the opposite of subtle, is what I'm saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI could switch Manticore from a software company to a conglomerate like Deva. That could explain why they both have a software company and a excavation firm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T16:42:13-08:00","id":1039676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039665#post1039665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bI could switch Manticore from a software company to a conglomerate like Deva. That could explain why they both have a software company and a excavation firm.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could. Of course depending on what you need, that oddity could be exactly what ropes your characters in.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T16:46:28-08:00","id":1039680,"title":"","content":"So, why excavate now, of all times? Is this instigated by the Machine, or is the CEO making their own play, and just now found out?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T16:50:50-08:00","id":1039683,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039680#post1039680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, why excavate now, of all times? Is this instigated by the Machine, or is the CEO making their own play, and just now found out?</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bThe Machine told the CEO to do so. It has found a new use for a artifact in the infrastructure. Also, I am moving the location to the jungles of South America, possibly Peru.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T18:52:48-08:00","id":1039737,"title":"","content":"I like the idea that its an infrastructure to resurrect a old destroyed angel for a job. The angel exists in a mummified state. So it the players corrupt the ritual they could make that angel fall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T19:00:21-08:00","id":1039742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039737#post1039737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the idea that its an infrastructure to resurrect a old destroyed angel for a job. The angel exists in a mummified state. So it the players corrupt the ritual they could make that angel fall.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds like a good idea. Also, could this scene fit into demon? <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQEJH_6kzs\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQEJH_6kzs</a> skip to 1:17. I am asking that because I feel tempted to add a fight scene similar to that into the scenario.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T19:02:49-08:00","id":1039743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Killerclown</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039742#post1039742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That sounds like a good idea. Also, could this scene fit into demon? <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQEJH_6kzs\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rvQEJH_6kzs</a> skip to 1:17. I am asking that because I feel tempted to add a fight scene similar to that into the scenario.</div> </div> </div> </div>That can fit really easy into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-28T19:08:49-08:00","id":1039744,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039743#post1039743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That can fit really easy into it.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bIn that case. You know how you suggested corrupting the ritual? Perhaps the ritual being ruined has horrific side affects and kills the people doing it like the villains in Raiders of the Lost Ark. Now that I think of it I might be putting a lot of Indiana Jones into a game meant to be about Techgnostic Espionage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-02T13:48:19-08:00","id":1042582,"title":"","content":"I did a similar idea in the deserts around Route 66 - I proposed a 1960's era God Machine project called 'The Boneyard' that at first glance seemed like it was an archeological dig. Since it was discovered after it was long since abandoned, it was largely an empty and desolate complex filled with cryptids.<br /> <br /> The majority of the research performed there involved the creation of genetically created life forms - entirely fictional giant lizard-like beings that resembled Dragons. Several head designers put together concept drawings and schematics for proposed examples and then the gene-team would go brew them up. After the animals were reared in captivity (most were engineered to be totally docile even if they looked fearsome) they were slaughtered and the remains chemically aged. The bones produced would be distributed to various places around the globe, allowing other God-Machine projects the concealment infrastructure they needed to perform extensive, deep exploratory digging.<br /> <br /> And that's where dinosaurs come from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3386-piff","name":"Piff","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3386_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"442"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T11:42:01-08:00","id":1043064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1039571#post1039571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is a software company sponsoring an archeological dig?</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds like an excellent question for characters to ask in game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-03T20:34:49-08:00","id":1043340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1039523-how-would-you-do-a-archeological-dig-as-a-god-machine-project?p=1043064#post1043064\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That sounds like an excellent question for characters to ask in game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here is the reason why <br /> Antikythera mechanism<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}